title: "Is your WordPress or Shopify site slow? A 10-minute check you can do yourself"
description: >-
  A step-by-step PageSpeed Insights walkthrough for small business owners on
  WordPress or Shopify: what the main numbers mean, the usual causes of a slow
  site, and what fixing it typically involves.
